   theta      E[H]       E[Phi'']    E[H+Phi'']   E[F^2]       Var(F)       E[F]       残差
   0.000pi  +0.448953  +0.201377  +0.650330271  +0.650330271  +0.650330271  +1.12e-18  -2.1e-15
   0.500pi  +0.430735  +0.226095  +0.656830104  +0.656830104  +0.656830104  -3.55e-15  +1.1e-16
