   => E[H+Phi''] = E[(G+Phi')^2] 全 theta 成立 (残差=机器精度) [T](代数)+[C](数值)
   => 且 cross-Stein(f=1): E[F]=E[G]+E[Phi']=E[d_vV]=0  =>  E[H+Phi''] = Var(F) (逐字 eq:stein2)

[S2] 展开 (theta=pi/2): E[H+Phi''] = E[G^2] + 2E[G Phi'] + E[Phi'^2] + 修正项
   E[G^2]           = +0.336496437
   2E[G Phi']       = +0.188477933
   E[Phi'^2]        = +0.131855735
   三项和            = +0.656830104
   E[H+Phi'']       = +0.656830104
   修正项 = 差       = +0.000e+00
   -E[F]^2          = -1.264e-29   (代数恒等: 修正项 == -E[F]^2)
   => 修正项 = 0 (机器精度). Phi 的 v-导数结构**不产生**额外项: 平直图里 v 是常系数场,
      散度算子 d_v 与 Hessian 的 d_v^2 是同一个算子 (无 transport/Christoffel 项).
      只有在非无散帧 (div_mu v != 0) 才会出现 修正项 = -E[(div_mu v) d_vV].

[S3] 判: E[kappa]-Var(F) = E[F]^2 ?  (kappa=H+Phi'', F=G+Phi')
   0.000pi: E[kappa]-Var(F) = -2.109e-15   E[F]^2 = 1.25e-36   E[kappa]=Var(F)=0.650330271
   0.500pi: E[kappa]-Var(F) = +1.110e-16   E[F]^2 = 1.26e-29   E[kappa]=Var(F)=0.656830104
   0.700pi: E[kappa]-Var(F) = +3.442e-15   E[F]^2 = 1.63e-29   E[kappa]=Var(F)=0.662361258
   1.000pi: E[kappa]-Var(F) = +1.710e-14   E[F]^2 = 1.48e-29   E[kappa]=Var(F)=0.670808978
   => 平方项 = E[F]^2, 而 E[F]=E[d_vV]=0 (score 零均值) 是**恒等**的,
      不是靠对称性; 故 平方 == 0, Stein 只给**等式** E[kappa]=Var(F), 没有余量.

[S3b] 对照: 无 Phi 的 q15 式 (E[H]-Var(G)=E[G]^2) 在 V-测度下**不成立**
   0.000pi: E[H]-Var(G) = +0.131956   E[G]^2 = +0.000000   差 +0.131956   W_geo=E[Phi'']-Var(Phi')=+0.131956   Cov(G,Phi')=+0.131956
   0.500pi: E[H]-Var(G) = +0.137494   E[G]^2 = +0.043255   差 +0.094239   W_geo=E[Phi'']-Var(Phi')=+0.137494   Cov(G,Phi')=+0.137494
   1.000pi: E[H]-Var(G) = +0.130912   E[G]^2 = +0.161630   差 -0.030718   W_geo=E[Phi'']-Var(Phi')=+0.130912   Cov(G,Phi')=+0.130912
   => V-测度下正确的关系是 E[H]-Var(G) = W_geo = Cov(G,Phi') (cross-Stein), 不是 E[G]^2 [T]+[C]

